We're doing everything
off the drive,

00:22:47.081 --> 00:22:49.535
but we did real-time
just last night.

00:22:49.536 --> 00:22:53.205
We had help from Bridj, Sateesh,

00:22:53.206 --> 00:22:54.590
Chris, all of them.

00:22:54.591 --> 00:22:57.300
Thank you so much.
Without further ado,

00:22:57.301 --> 00:22:59.310
I'll call Prashant
