&gt;&gt; Okay. So, meanwhile, I can
do a demo on the small kit.

00:23:02.641 --> 00:23:06.055
So, this is a STM32M4
Microcontroller.

00:23:06.056 --> 00:23:09.155
So, it is having
a RAM size of 128 KB.

00:23:09.156 --> 00:23:11.860
So, we are having
the biggest challenge that,

00:23:11.861 --> 00:23:13.650
to take the audio real-time,

00:23:13.651 --> 00:23:16.200
to process that, prediction,

00:23:16.201 --> 00:23:19.165
everything we have to do in
the small amount of time.

00:23:19.166 --> 00:23:21.230
So, I will be giving
the demo on that.

00:23:21.231 --> 00:23:24.385
So, you can see that
for prediction,

00:23:24.386 --> 00:23:27.560
for prototyping we are
