00:25:14.851 --> 00:25:18.975
&gt;&gt; The size is what is
really exciting for us;

00:25:18.976 --> 00:25:20.070
size and the power consumption.

00:25:20.071 --> 00:25:21.225
&gt;&gt; All these in real-time.

00:25:21.226 --> 00:25:22.800
&gt;&gt; Yes. All this in

00:25:22.801 --> 00:25:25.000
less than 89 milliseconds
is what we calculated.

00:25:25.001 --> 00:25:26.690
&gt;&gt; What helped us to
achieve this was,

